<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Concern over LSI Q3 revenue.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Concern over LSI Q3 revenue.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>LSI Logic Corp's revenue growth could be less than expected in the third quarter, Montgomery Securities analyst Clark Westmont said in a research report Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Westmont said he was comfortable with estimates for the June quarter, but said the computer chipmaker has been &quot;cautious&quot; about prospects for the September quarter.</p>
<p>-- Revenue growth in the third quarter could be less than Montgomery's previous forecast of 9 percent over the June quarter.</p>
</text>
